# Project Goal

This is a **pointer**, not the definition. This file used to describe DGFY as a single-vertical
"Inventory Management System for Food & Beverage Operations" (originally "SKU Inventory Manager")
— that framing is stale (#365). DGFY is a multi-tenant, multi-vertical commerce/operations platform
(POS, inventory, storefront, bookings, hospitality) across capability-driven workflow modes, not a
single-vertical F&B tool.

**Read `AGENTS.md` in full and follow it.** It is the canonical, always-current project entry
point — repo layout, PR conventions, agent roles, and the doc lookup order all live there. Do not
duplicate its content here; a rule restated in a vendor directory is exactly the staleness failure
this file itself became an example of.
